        <item>
            <title>0.1.16</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 12 Aug 2026 02:15:50 +0100</pubDate>
            <link>https://thisweek.is</link>
            <sparkle:version>0.1.16</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.16</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>10.13</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>ThisWeek Desktop 0.1.16</h2>
<p>Meetings in the menu bar.</p>
<ul>
  <li>Menu bar shows an upcoming meeting countdown next to the tick when something starts within an hour.</li>
  <li>Tray menu lists next, today, and tomorrow meetings — click one to open or create its note.</li>
  <li>New Note and Settings are available from the tray; flash errors can be dismissed with ×.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
